<release date="2022-11-28" version="2.43" title="Bug Fix">
    <release-core-list>
        <release-bug-list>
            <release-item>
                <commit subject="Move manifestBackupLabelSet() test in info/manifest unit."/>
                <commit subject="Fix missing reference in diff/incr backup.">
                    <github-issue id="1933"/>
                    <github-pull-request id="1935"/>
                </commit>

                <release-item-contributor-list>
                    <release-item-ideator id="marcel.borger"/>
                    <release-item-ideator id="ulfedf"/>
                    <release-item-ideator id="jaymefSO"/>
                    <release-item-contributor id="david.steele"/>
                    <release-item-reviewer id="stefan.fercot"/>
                </release-item-contributor-list>

                <p>Fix missing reference in diff/incr backup.</p>

                <p>In v2.42 a diff or incr backup failed with <quote>unable to find '...' in string list</quote> when its prior backup was made by an earlier version. The reference list built for a manifest from an earlier version now includes the backup's own label.</p>
            </release-item>
        </release-bug-list>

        <release-improvement-list>
            <release-item>
                <github-issue id="1925"/>
                <github-pull-request id="1929"/>

                <release-item-contributor-list>
                    <release-item-contributor id="david.steele"/>
                    <release-item-reviewer id="stefan.fercot"/>
                </release-item-contributor-list>

                <p>Add hint when an option is specified without an index.</p>

                <p>An option that requires an index, e.g. <setting>repo-storage-ca-file</setting>, now errors with a hint that shows the indexed name, e.g. <setting>repo1-storage-ca-file</setting>. A deprecated option also gets a hint with its current name.</p>
            </release-item>
        </release-improvement-list>

        <release-development-list>
            <release-item>
                <release-item-contributor-list>
                    <release-item-contributor id="david.steele"/>
                </release-item-contributor-list>

                <p>Update config.guess and config.sub to latest versions.</p>
            </release-item>
        </release-development-list>
    </release-core-list>
</release>
